{
  "_README": [
    "Mix Nova — plant master data. Copy this file to plant-config.json, fill in",
    "the values, then run:   node scripts/setup/apply-plant-config.mjs",
    "",
    "RULES",
    "  - Leave a value as \"\" or null to KEEP what is already in the app.",
    "    Nothing is ever blanked out by an empty field.",
    "  - The *Code fields identify the existing record. Do not change them",
    "    unless you mean to point at a different record.",
    "  - Safe to run more than once: it only sends fields you filled in.",
    "  - plant-config.json is git-ignored, so your real data is never committed.",
    "",
    "NOT HANDLED HERE (deliberately)",
    "  - The M25 mix design. Approved recipes are version-controlled for QC,",
    "    so a new version must be raised and approved in the app:",
    "    Production -> Mix Designs -> M25-STD -> New version.",
    "  - New records. This edits the starter records the seeder created. Add",
    "    further customers/sites/vehicles in the app, or by CSV import on each",
    "    Masters screen."
  ],

